    "Add HomePod mini to the same home in Apple's Home app. It provides supported home hub, Thread and Siri functions independently. Choose it through AirPlay for audio. HomePad cannot access its microphone, host Siri, or send Intercom messages.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add HomePod mini to the same home in Apple's Home app. It provides supported home hub, Thread and Siri functions independently. Choose it through AirPlay for audio. HomePad cannot access its microphone, host Siri, or send Intercom messages."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Apple 家庭中将 HomePod mini 添加到同一家庭。它独立提供家庭中枢、Thread 和 Siri 功能；音频通过 AirPlay 选择。本应用不使用它的麦克风，也不运行 Siri 或广播功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a compatible camera in Apple Home, then refresh here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add a compatible camera in Apple Home, then refresh here."
