    "Current conditions are weather-model estimates. Refreshes every 15 minutes while visible. City searches and the selected city's coordinates are sent to Open-Meteo. With your permission, Apple Location Services finds your city. Coordinates sent for weather are rounded to about 1 km. No background location tracking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Current conditions are weather-model estimates. Refreshes every 15 minutes while visible. City searches and the selected city's coordinates are sent to Open-Meteo. With your permission, Apple Location Services finds your city. Coordinates sent for weather are rounded to about 1 km. No background location tracking."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前天气为气象模型估算，显示期间每 15 分钟刷新。城市搜索和所选城市坐标会发送到 Open-Meteo。经你允许后，Apple 定位服务用于查找城市；天气请求中的坐标会取整到约 1 公里精度，不在后台追踪位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
