    "Optional front-camera detection checks only whether a face is present during standby. It does not identify people, record video, save images or send them anywhere. The system camera indicator stays visible while detecting. Detection pauses for sheets and when the app leaves the foreground.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional front-camera detection checks only whether a face is present during standby. It does not identify people, record video, save images or send them anywhere. The system camera indicator stays visible while detecting. Detection pauses for sheets and when the app leaves the foreground."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可选的前置相机只在待机时检测是否有人脸，不识别身份，不录像、不保存、不上传图像。检测时系统相机指示灯保持可见，打开面板或离开应用后暂停。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional: also use the camera on other HomePad pages. A person in view delays standby; Auto-Lock still follows your display setting. The camera indicator stays visible; menus and the background pause detection. No identity recognition, recordings, saved images or uploads. Turn this off at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional: also use the camera on other HomePad pages. A person in view delays standby; Auto-Lock still follows your display setting. The camera indicator stays visible; menus and the background pause detection. No identity recognition, recordings, saved images or uploads. Turn this off at any time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可选：在 HomePad 其他页面也使用相机。检测到人脸时延后待机；自动锁定仍按你的显示设置执行。相机指示灯会亮起；菜单打开或 App 进入后台时暂停。不识别身份、不录制、不保存或上传图像，可随时关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional: keep HomePad open as a dedicated display. Set this up yourself in iPad Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional: keep HomePad open as a dedicated display. Set this up yourself in iPad Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可选：将 iPad 固定用于 HomePad 展示。请自行在 iPad 设置中开启。"
