          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "达到时长后保留当前页并调暗。首次触摸只恢复亮度，不操作控件；音乐可继续播放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The default background appears after you remove the photo wallpaper.": {
      "localizations": {
