        }
      }
    },
    "This also uses the camera on non-standby pages while HomePad is in the foreground. Face presence delays automatic standby; system Auto-Lock follows Screen behavior. No identity recognition, recordings, saved images or uploads. The camera indicator stays visible. Panels and the background pause detection. You can turn this off at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This also uses the camera on non-standby pages while HomePad is in the foreground. Face presence delays automatic standby; system Auto-Lock follows Screen behavior. No identity recognition, recordings, saved images or uploads. The camera indicator stays visible. Panels and the background pause detection. You can turn this off at any time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这也会在 HomePad 前台的非待机页面使用相机。有人脸在场时延后自动待机；系统自动锁定遵循「屏幕行为」设置。不识别身份，不录像、不保存图片、不上传。系统相机指示会持续显示。打开面板或进入后台时暂停检测；你可以随时关闭此选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This audio file cannot be played.": {
