            "value": "使用 iPad 的本地时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses the iPad's local time. Night mode darkens the app and gives the standby clock a subdued warm color. Screen brightness is restored when standby ends or the app leaves the foreground.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses the iPad's local time. Night mode darkens the app and gives the standby clock a subdued warm color. Screen brightness is restored when standby ends or the app leaves the foreground."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 iPad 的本地时间。夜间模式降低界面明亮程度，待机时钟使用柔和暖色。退出待机或离开应用后，屏幕亮度会恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
