    "When HomePad is open": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When HomePad is open"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 HomePad 时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, the front camera stays active while this app is in the foreground to keep the display awake while a face is present and to wake it from standby. It does not identify people, record video, save images or send them anywhere. The system camera indicator stays visible. Detection pauses for panels and when the app leaves the foreground.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When enabled, the front camera stays active while this app is in the foreground to keep the display awake while a face is present and to wake it from standby. It does not identify people, record video, save images or send them anywhere. The system camera indicator stays visible. Detection pauses for panels and when the app leaves the foreground."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，前置相机在应用前台持续工作，检测到人脸在场时保持亮屏，也可从待机恢复。不识别身份、不录像、不保存或上传画面。系统相机指示会持续显示；打开面板或离开前台时暂停检测。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the iPad is upright, still and untouched, show the standby clock after the selected delay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When the iPad is upright, still and untouched, show the standby clock after the selected delay."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPad 竖放、静止且无人操作时，达到设定时间后显示待机时钟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When to enter standby": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When to enter standby"
